      "name": "1980s underground tram",
      "names": {"uk":"Підземний трамвай 1980-х"},
      "description": "Kharkivmetroproekt's 1978–79 technical project for UkrkomunNDIproekt: metro-sized tunnels under the centre, entered by surface tram lines, in two radii crossing at Vozziednannia (Soborna) Square, then a third radius to the station. Its surface feeder on Sakharova and Kniahyni Olhy streets opened in 1987 and the first shaft was sunk behind the Potocki Palace in 1989, then the work was frozen.",
